      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have been informed by the New York Telephone Company that orders for telephone service have been made in ways that are inconsistent with Executive Order No. 161, such order having been re-enacted by Mayor Lindsay on January 3, 1966. Its purpose is to simplify and make uniform procedures for providing suitable telephone service throughout the city.",
